1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,580
So if you're holding one tonight, here's the only thing I ask

2
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:06,260
Don't leave it in a drawer to gather dust with all your past

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:10,020
Find a pencil, find a neighbor, find a window with no light

4
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:14,260
Write the words you wish somebody would have told you on your night

5
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:17,540
Leave it on a windshield, tuck it in a library book

6
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,000
Slip it in a stranger's pocket when nobody's there to look
